Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.42,0:00:04.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The world is awash in pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.63,0:00:09.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The Great War was the biggest war in human history,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.50,0:00:13.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and it left the world's nations with deep scars.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.67,0:00:16.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's Corpse,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.21,0:00:18.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,just like Teach predicted.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.42,0:00:22.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's impossible...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.42,0:00:24.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There was over two hundred meters between us!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.67,0:00:29.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's conclusion brought about\Na radical change in world affairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.17,0:00:41.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Eat this, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.50,0:00:44.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've got more where that came from!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.96,0:00:49.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Urgh...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.79,0:00:51.42,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,He moves with such poise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.92,0:00:53.83,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,But we've got a surprise for him up ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.63,0:00:55.83,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,That's the spot!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.08,0:01:10.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The politicians all realized how poor\Nthe cost-performance of war was.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.50,0:01:12.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Due to how advanced modern science was,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.83,0:01:14.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,weapons were too effective at killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.88,0:01:29.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeesh, that's one ugly mug you've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.46,0:01:37.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, well, looks like you have some chops.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.13,0:01:39.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Compliments from the enemy?\NThat's a new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.67,0:01:42.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For all your talent, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.79,0:01:44.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,you're green as hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.25,0:01:54.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bonfire! My rival!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.92,0:01:56.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We finally meet!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.63,0:02:10.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,With that, the era of nations pointing their guns\Nat each other out in the open came to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.96,0:02:15.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, battles are fought between spies\Nover information -
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.08,0:02:16.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,in shadow wars.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.04,0:02:19.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We managed to avoid having any civvies get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.63,0:02:20.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.42,0:02:22.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're not going to kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.17,0:02:24.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is something you need to remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.58,0:02:26.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When a spy gets captured,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.75,0:02:28.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,the only fate that awaits them is a\Ndarkness deeper than death.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.33,0:02:37.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, we still don't have a lead on their whereabouts?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.75,0:02:40.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I hope they just forgot what day\Nthey were supposed to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.67,0:02:43.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Given who we're talking about,\NI don't think that's likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.63,0:02:48.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We should assume that something,\Nor someone, must be stopping them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.46,0:02:59.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We ran a background check on Uwe's new maids,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.33,0:03:01.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and it came back clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.33,0:03:02.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.33,0:03:03.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thanks for taking care of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.04,0:03:09.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That was some fine work, rooting out\Nand capturing Corpse's co-conspirator Olivia.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.00,0:03:16.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Uwe is a good man, so it means a lot that\Nthey were able to keep him alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.75,0:03:20.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It would seem that Flower Garden, Pandemonium,\NMeadow, and Daughter Dearest
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.67,0:03:24.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,are capable of operating just fine, even without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.50,0:03:26.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't know if I'd go that far.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.46,0:03:32.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your chosen squad of Glint, Dreamspeaker,\NForgetter, and Fool
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.00,0:03:34.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,did an excellent job capturing Corpse, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.33,0:03:35.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.33,0:03:39.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They all showed striking levels of growth\Non this last mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.63,0:03:43.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,However, what's this I hear about the\Nchosen squad failing to return?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.96,0:03:45.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're still keeping us under observation?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.96,0:03:48.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Draw whatever conclusions you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.25,0:03:52.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here at HQ, we're considering the possibility\Nthat they've turned traitor
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.58,0:03:54.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and are planning on organizing a manhunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.88,0:03:55.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.88,0:03:57.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let me handle this one in-house.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.96,0:03:59.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's no need for you to get involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.83,0:04:03.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Seriously, out with it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.83,0:04:07.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What have you all been spending\Nthis past month doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.71,0:04:10.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right! I've been really curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.33,0:04:13.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And why'd my bedroom get blown up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.08,0:04:15.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There was a mishap.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.63,0:04:17.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.13,0:04:19.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It was the day we set out on the Corpse mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.17,0:04:25.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good hunting out, you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.38,0:04:27.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Promise me you'll come back in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.25,0:04:29.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course, and thank you for seeing us off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.83,0:04:31.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Lily?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.71,0:04:33.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There isn't much pep in your step.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.08,0:04:37.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's nothing, I was just a bit worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.04,0:04:40.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was afraid this whole selection process would\Nmake things awkward between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.42,0:04:42.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm not mad in the slightest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.08,0:04:46.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If anything, I'm happy that your hard work\Nis getting recognized.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.75,0:04:50.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, all right then!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.21,0:04:54.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Chosen Wunderkind Lily is on the job!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.21,0:04:59.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're gone, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.88,0:05:07.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'M SO MAAAAAAAD!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.63,0:05:10.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was so sure I was going to get chosen!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.63,0:05:12.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with me, huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.63,0:05:16.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why won't Teach respect my talents?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.67,0:05:18.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.33,0:05:20.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Teach!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.38,0:05:21.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How much of that did you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.92,0:05:23.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Pull yourself together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.63,0:05:26.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have an important job for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.54,0:05:34.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I sent Grete and the other three off to\Nroot out one of Corpse's allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.96,0:05:40.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You four are the ones I'm taking with me\Nto actually fight Corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.79,0:05:42.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That makes perfect sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.04,0:05:43.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I never doubted you for a moment, Teach.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.54,0:05:48.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Corpse won't hesitate to kill a dozen bystanders\Nif it will let him assassinate his target.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.96,0:05:52.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The objective is to capture him\Nwithout suffering a single civilian casualty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.08,0:05:54.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Doing that will require manpower,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.08,0:05:57.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but I'm not interested in bringing\Nyou along just to have you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.13,0:06:00.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's why I've prepared a test for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.88,0:06:02.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What kind of test?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.13,0:06:04.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Touch my hand by the time evening falls.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.63,0:06:05.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's the test.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.92,0:06:09.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you fail, I'll have to fight Corpse on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.88,0:06:11.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm confident that you're up to the challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.38,0:06:14.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is what I selected the\Nteam's strongest members for.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.21,0:06:16.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Leave it to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.42,0:06:18.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We won't betray your trust!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.63,0:06:19.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.17,0:06:23.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Come on, everyone, let's have a strategy meeting!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.67,0:06:24.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.92,0:06:28.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's one thing you should know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.50,0:06:32.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Monika, Erna, and Annette all ran into\Nsetbacks at their academies
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.96,0:06:35.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,due to their inability to cooperate with others.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.71,0:06:39.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,However, completing this mission is going to\Nrequire rock-solid teamwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.71,0:06:42.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I get that, but you're not saying...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.29,0:06:44.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bring the team together.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.83,0:06:47.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is the important job you had for me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.71,0:06:58.21,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd start with the most reasonable of the three\Nand work my way up, but I guess that's off the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.13,0:07:06.17,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,All those times I actually led us were\Nwhen we had the whole team here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.79,0:07:09.08,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Lily's antics always lightened the mood,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.08,0:07:14.33,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,and that combined with Sybilla's retorts and\NSara's reactions were what really brought us together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.67,0:07:18.67,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,And Grete's the one person who can hold\Na decent conversation, but now she's gone, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.92,0:07:21.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Still, I need to find a way for us to work together!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.42,0:07:27.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did that come from Lily's room?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.21,0:07:32.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What, did you need something?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.58,0:07:35.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For starters, what are you doing in Lily's room?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.54,0:07:39.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's something I wanted to look into\Nwhile we had the place nice and empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.75,0:07:41.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,About Heat Haze Palace, you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.21,0:07:42.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.75,0:07:44.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Isn't it obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.21,0:07:45.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.46,0:07:47.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How are we going to pass the test?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.08,0:07:49.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That hardly seems worth discussing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.67,0:07:52.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's not like teaming up with you lot is going to\Nbe enough for me to complete it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.88,0:07:55.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, don't just go deciding that on your own!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.25,0:07:56.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Can you leave now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.67,0:07:58.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm going to fly this one solo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.58,0:08:05.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's chat, Erna.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.75,0:08:11.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wh- Erna!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.17,0:08:12.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We need to talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.75,0:08:14.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Erna, open up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.96,0:08:21.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You keep your room really neat, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.21,0:08:27.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, Erna, about that test-
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.46,0:08:28.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.71,0:08:30.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I fought through my shyness to let\Nsomeone into my room
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.67,0:08:34.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and have a conversation with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.63,0:08:37.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm all tired out now, so I'm going to take a nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.04,0:08:41.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But we haven't even talked about anything yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.63,0:08:48.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Forget rock-solid, we aren't rock-anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.08,0:08:51.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Plus, this last girl is the one that\Nworries me most of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.33,0:08:53.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Amnesia?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.79,0:08:58.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right, Annette doesn't remember anything\Nfrom before she joined her academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.08,0:09:02.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Her papers list her as being fourteen,\Nbut it's unclear if even that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.38,0:09:07.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She got taken in by the state with\Nno memories or birth certificate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.00,0:09:11.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, that's why her code name is Forgetter...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.50,0:09:18.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Annette, I know you're in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.25,0:09:26.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Come on, Annette.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.96,0:09:28.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Up and at 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.75,0:09:31.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm awake, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.63,0:09:33.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's up, Sis?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.79,0:09:37.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm at kind of a loss about this test Teach gave us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.75,0:09:39.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Would you mind helping me out?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.83,0:09:42.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, I already gave it a go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.83,0:09:43.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.83,0:09:47.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was all like, "Bro, let me touch your hand,"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.33,0:09:48.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but he said no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.63,0:09:50.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's why I went to bed in a huff!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.92,0:10:00.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It can't be done!\NThere's no way I can corral those three!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.96,0:10:04.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have to get these mice to\Nthe handler by this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.04,0:10:06.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I don't have time for this right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.08,0:10:08.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Between this and that tantrum earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.92,0:10:11.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,you really need to work on your mental fortitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.17,0:10:13.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You think I don't know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.33,0:10:16.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it,\Nyou're oddly well-informed about Inferno.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.08,0:10:18.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.33,0:10:19.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.08,0:10:25.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Seven years ago, a crimson-haired woman\Nfrom Inferno saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.42,0:10:28.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's my savior, and the person I aspire to be like.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.96,0:10:31.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.17,0:10:32.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A crimson-haired woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.04,0:10:35.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That would be code name Hearth.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.71,0:10:37.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She was Inferno's previous boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.08,0:10:42.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We were as close as a family in Inferno,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.25,0:10:44.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but we fought constantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.92,0:10:46.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Our boss was a kind person,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.92,0:10:49.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but when we were arguing,\Nshe could be as stubborn as the best of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.75,0:10:53.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We all had our own opinions,\Nand those opinions often came into conflict.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.17,0:10:55.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have to say, I'm a bit surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.79,0:10:57.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Enjoy that discord."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.58,0:11:00.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Differences between allies are\Nthe key to a strong team."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.63,0:11:03.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's a quote I cribbed off the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.67,0:11:05.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ms. Hearth said that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.38,0:11:06.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.83,0:11:09.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The best approach is to butt heads\Nwith your teammates directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.58,0:11:25.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What has she been up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.21,0:11:45.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Faucets: garden, kitchen,\Nmain bath, all done. Bathroom..."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.46,0:11:47.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is this information about Heat Haze Palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.00,0:11:51.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Lily: slightly larger than other bedrooms."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.38,0:11:53.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Old boss's room?"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.67,0:12:05.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lily's room used to belong to Ms. Hearth?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.63,0:12:10.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you hone that ability of yours,\Nyou'll be the strongest spy around.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.58,0:12:12.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But the thing is,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.04,0:12:14.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't want you to be just any old spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.88,0:12:17.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want you to become a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.29,0:12:24.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go protect the citizens\Nyou once gave your all to defending.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.96,0:12:27.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And I'm going to do it with the power\Nyou helped me discover.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.00,0:12:29.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm code name Dreamspeaker,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.46,0:12:32.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and it's time to lure them to their ruin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.08,0:12:45.08,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I really should have continued that\Nconversation with Big Sis Thea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.08,0:12:46.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why, if it isn't Erna!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.58,0:12:49.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's no need to look so startled.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.92,0:12:51.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you on cooking duty?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.25,0:12:52.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who's your partner?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.75,0:12:54.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's Big Sis Monika.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.54,0:12:58.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She left me a note that said to wait here\Nand went off somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.29,0:13:00.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What, she blew you off?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.88,0:13:02.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.25,0:13:03.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,About earlier...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.83,0:13:06.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Erna, do you want to become close with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.21,0:13:09.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.33,0:13:12.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Would you want to get close with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.46,0:13:14.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,even if it meant having to expose\Nyour innermost secrets?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.83,0:13:17.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I... I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.04,0:13:18.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.04,0:13:22.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then, for the next three seconds,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.83,0:13:25.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,would you mind looking me in the eye?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.96,0:13:31.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Erna...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.58,0:13:35.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You want a real big sister, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.50,0:13:40.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, that's why you call us all "Big Sis."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.67,0:13:42.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Dearie me...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.21,0:13:44.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You want so badly to be doted on,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.50,0:13:47.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but you hold it back and never let it show.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.96,0:13:49.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.17,0:13:52.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I just don't want you to get\Ncaught up in my misfortune...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.13,0:13:53.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What a big baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.38,0:13:55.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No! That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.83,0:13:58.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.04,0:14:01.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll be your big sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.04,0:14:06.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can cry, and I won't tell the others.\NOh, my adorable little sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.46,0:14:07.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeep...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.58,0:14:09.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You don't have to be ashamed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.92,0:14:13.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just throw away your ideals and\Nbe honest with yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.33,0:14:18.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can fulfill all the secret wishes\Nyou can't share with anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.25,0:14:32.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What did you just do to Erna?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.63,0:14:34.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just a little trick I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.71,0:14:36.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can see what people desire.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.42,0:14:38.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't learn any details, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.13,0:14:41.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'd be happy to teach you how to do it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.83,0:14:43.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In fact, I can teach you all\Nmy techniques for seducing men.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.88,0:14:45.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I literally couldn't be less interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.38,0:14:47.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, it's really all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.63,0:14:52.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll have you know that I taught Grete\Neverything she knows about seduction!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.04,0:14:55.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So you're the one behind her pathetic\Nattempts at sexual harassment?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.71,0:14:57.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey now, she's doing her best!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.21,0:15:01.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I swear, you're all a bunch of softies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.58,0:15:04.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Spies need to be ruthless,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.50,0:15:07.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and that's something this team is sorely lacking.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.17,0:15:14.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.25,0:15:16.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh hey, it's Thea!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.58,0:15:19.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The faucet was broken, so I fixed it, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.42,0:15:22.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why are there three of them now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.75,0:15:26.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I replicated everything,\Nfrom its shape down to its stains.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.21,0:15:27.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's only one right one,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.46,0:15:29.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and if you turn the wrong one,\Nit makes a huge explosion!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.13,0:15:33.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You really are an genius when it comes to tinkering.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.58,0:15:35.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Say, Annette...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.54,0:15:37.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you want to get close with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.63,0:15:40.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Even if it means having to\Nopen your heart up to me a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.29,0:15:43.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.29,0:15:45.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wanna get close with you, Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.13,0:15:48.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay, then can you look me in the eye?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.50,0:15:55.29,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,My body's fighting back?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.54,0:15:57.83,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,It's telling me not to look into Annette's heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.29,0:16:05.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How'd it go, Sis?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.88,0:16:07.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did you see my desires?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.25,0:16:10.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes, well, um, is it just me...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.79,0:16:13.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,or have you gotten taller lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.54,0:16:15.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's amazing, Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.25,0:16:16.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.50,0:16:18.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I totally did, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.00,0:16:21.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've grown three whole millimeters in the past month.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.83,0:16:23.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And it's all because I changed the way I sleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.08,0:16:27.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, once we finish the test,\NI'll make you some milk pudding.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.42,0:16:30.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yo, that'll make me grow even taller!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.00,0:16:33.29,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Annette's mind is like that of a five-year-old.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.54,0:16:37.29,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,All I was able to find in there was\Na desire to grow taller.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.58,0:16:40.83,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Is there really nothing else that she wants?\N{\rSubtitle-3}Milk pudding! Milk pudding!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.29,0:16:45.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All right, gang, let's go finish this test!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.92,0:16:47.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm in, yo!\N{\rSubtitle-4}Yeep!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.00,0:16:51.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Big Sis Thea?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.08,0:16:53.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It just feels like it was such a battle getting here...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.67,0:17:00.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It seems as though Lily's room used to\Nbelong to Inferno's old boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.29,0:17:03.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm going to use that fact to lure Teach inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.50,0:17:06.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Annette, I need you to rig Lily's room with traps.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.17,0:17:07.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Roger that, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.17,0:17:09.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Erna, your job is going to be to\Nnarrowly slip past the traps
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.88,0:17:11.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and touch Teach's hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.33,0:17:12.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.54,0:17:14.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.50,0:17:17.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's time for us to show just what we're made of!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.88,0:17:30.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There we go, all done.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.46,0:17:34.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did you not end up working together?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.46,0:17:38.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Touching your hand was as easy as\Npreventing you from washing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.38,0:17:39.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.92,0:17:42.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Klaus was handling animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.33,0:17:46.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,People always wash their hands after they do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.08,0:17:50.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I broke the faucet out in the garden ahead of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.42,0:17:53.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then, I stationed Erna in the kitchen
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.00,0:17:55.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and sent Annette over to the other bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.88,0:18:00.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The communal bath is girls-only,\Nso Teach was never gonna go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.00,0:18:03.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The only place left for him to wash his hands\Nwas the sink in this bathroom here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.33,0:18:06.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All I had to do was lie here in wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.67,0:18:08.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Remember what I told you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.46,0:18:11.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have to hand the pets over to\Nthe handler this afternoon,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.58,0:18:12.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so I'm short on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.13,0:18:15.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My only option was to give up and offer her my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.92,0:18:17.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thanks, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.29,0:18:19.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You all made for a great diversion.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.50,0:18:21.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,W-we what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.29,0:18:25.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That note I left in Lily's room got you real fired up, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.33,0:18:29.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I appreciate you babysitting the kids like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.08,0:18:30.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,N-now listen here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.04,0:18:32.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.17,0:18:35.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Differences between allies are\Nthe key to a strong team."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.38,0:18:38.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What I expect out of you four
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.71,0:18:42.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,is for you to cooperate by butting heads\Nand stripping each other's egos raw.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.96,0:18:45.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By pushing each other, you push yourselves forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.92,0:18:47.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's how we're going to defeat Corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.83,0:18:50.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.04,0:18:52.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You picked up my scraps,\Nand now you get to go on the mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.00,0:18:53.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've had about enough of your snark.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.71,0:18:54.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sis...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.25,0:18:59.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We've been waiting for Klaus to\Nshow up for forever, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.21,0:19:00.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is he coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.50,0:19:01.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.71,0:19:04.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Monika actually already finished the test.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.42,0:19:05.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What a bummer!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.58,0:19:07.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And after I added a second doorknob
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.54,0:19:10.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and made it so that if you turned the wrong one,\Neverything would explode, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.42,0:19:12.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You need to disarm it at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.29,0:19:17.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's not like anyone would fall for anything\Nthat obviously suspicious, but still...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.92,0:19:27.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How unlucky...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.42,0:19:31.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When I got back from the bathroom,\Nthere was an extra doorknob.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.67,0:19:41.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I feel like this is Erna's fault for fiddling with stuff\Nwhen she knows how unlucky she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.96,0:19:46.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I say it's Annette's fault for using such\Na ridiculous amount of blasting powder!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.04,0:19:49.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was just following Thea's orders, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.33,0:19:51.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A-as far as I'm concerned,\Nnone of this would have happened
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.92,0:19:53.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,if Monika had just worked with us from the start!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.83,0:19:55.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You are not pinning this on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.92,0:19:58.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess I need to make one amendment.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.58,0:20:01.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I won't ask you to be the best of friends...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.88,0:20:04.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.50,0:20:08.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...please at least try to work together.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.79,0:20:13.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...and that's how it all went down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.58,0:20:16.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is it just me, or do those four sound kinda unhinged?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.58,0:20:19.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Be that as it may, they're each incredibly talented.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.38,0:20:21.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They completed the mission without a hitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.46,0:20:25.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, well, if they were really that great,\Nthey wouldn't have blown up my room!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.29,0:20:30.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Afterwards, they decided to take\Nsome time off at the mission site.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.63,0:20:33.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, we still don't know why they haven't called.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.92,0:20:35.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We need to go look for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.21,0:20:37.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You all go on ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.38,0:20:41.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have another mission to take care of,\Nbut I'll join up with you as soon as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.46,0:20:42.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I disagree.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.96,0:20:45.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Every second could very well end up mattering.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.46,0:20:47.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You should prioritize the search efforts.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.88,0:20:51.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, go help out the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.46,0:20:55.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I know it's not much,\Nbut I'll do what I can to help out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.63,0:20:57.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You've really grown to be dependable.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.71,0:20:58.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.08,0:21:01.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll leave the mission to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.29,0:21:03.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But, um, what about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.96,0:21:05.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lily, you're with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.88,0:21:08.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The two of us are going to go track down our team.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.17,0:21:10.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.42,0:21:12.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This will be an emergency mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.42,0:21:14.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We need to find our missing teammates.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.50,0:22:49.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Seriously, what's the deal with this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.92,0:22:51.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why go to a pool at night?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.54,0:22:54.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And what's with the skeevy lighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.08,0:22:56.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We just finished a mission, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.96,0:23:00.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sometimes, you have to give yourself\Na little reward to make it all worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.33,0:23:04.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If Klaus hadn't given us specific orders,\NI would have ditched you ages ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.42,0:23:07.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And if you did that,\Nwho would have looked after the kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.54,0:23:09.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Behold, my special deluxe squirt gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.96,0:23:11.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Open fire, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.38,0:23:12.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeep!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.13,0:23:14.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How unlucky...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.42,0:23:17.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You've probably noticed too,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.71,0:23:21.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but Annette's engineering is beyond\Nanything our nation is capable of.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.58,0:23:23.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It does seem that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.63,0:23:26.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Where'd she come from, I wonder?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.04,0:23:36.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.08,0:23:39.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm this girl's mother.
